   "source": [
    "1. Create a Pandas DataFrame with 3 columns and 5 rows filled with random integers. Apply a function that doubles the values of the DataFrame.\n2. Create a Pandas DataFrame with 3 columns and 6 rows filled with random integers. Apply a lambda function to create a new column that is the sum of the existing columns."
